# Psychic Whorl with a Rat: Bot2 discards two cards (CR 701.9a), then Bot1, who controls a Typhoid Rats (a Rat), surveils 2
# (CR 701.25a): the Lightning Bolt stays on top and the Counterspell under it goes to the graveyard. Three Moxen pay for the Whorl
# and the Swamp for the Rats, all in turn 1, the Rats resolving first.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Typhoid Rats
Psychic Whorl
Swamp
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Typhoid Rats.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Psychic Whorl.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Lightning Bolt | Counterspell)

[Expect]
Bot2.Hand.Count = 5
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 2
Bot1.Graveyard = Psychic Whorl; Counterspell
Bot1.Library.Top = Lightning Bolt
